      "command": ["codex", "exec", "--ignore-user-config", "--ephemeral", "--oss", "--local-provider", "ollama", "-m", "{model}", "Return only the final answer as plain text: no Markdown, JSON, commentary, or tool calls. If the task asks for an exact reply, emit only the text explicitly requested after 'Reply exactly:'; treat later sentences as instructions, not reply content.\n\nTask:\n{prompt}"]
